1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nd7 5. Nf3 Ngf6 6. Bd3 Nxe4 7. Bxe4 Nf6 8. Bd3 b6 9. Bg5 Bb7 10. O-O Be7 11. Qe2 O-O 12. Rad1 h6 13. Bf4 Qd5 { Key: 13...Qd5? The queen leaves the kingside to look for pawns; 13...Bd6 was level (engine +1.1 after the game move). } 14. c4 { Key: 14.c4: the queen is driven away and White gains a tempo. } 14... Qa5 15. Bxc7 { Key: 15.Bxc7 wins a pawn. } 15... Bxf3 16. gxf3 Qxa2 { Key: 16...Qxa2? The queen grabs a pawn far from her king. 16...Qh5 was the last chance (engine +1.3 against +4.0). } 17. Ra1 Qb3 18. Bc2 Qb4 19. Ra4 { Key: 17.Ra1 Qb3 18.Bc2 Qb4 19.Ra4: every white move gains time on the queen while the rooks and bishops point at the king (engine +4.0). Mieses resigned. } 1-0

