1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Nc3 e6 5. Bd3 Bd6 6. f4 O-O 7. Nf3 dxc4 8. Bb1 { Key: 7...dxc4 8.Bb1: the bishop stays on the diagonal that points at h7. } 8... b5 9. e4 Be7 10. Ng5 h6 11. h4 { Key: 11.h4! g6 12.e5 hxg5 13.hxg5: White gives the knight to open the h-file. } 11... g6 { Key: 11...g6? 11...c5 hit the centre first (engine -0.7 against +0.5). } 12. e5 hxg5 13. hxg5 Nd5 14. Kf1 Nxc3 15. bxc3 Bb7 { Key: 15...Bb7? 15...Bd7 defended (engine 0.00 against +1.5). } 16. Qg4 Kg7 17. Rh7+ { Key: 17.Rh7+ Kxh7 18.Qh5+ Kg8 19.Bxg6: a rook and a bishop are given to reach the king with the queen. } 17... Kxh7 18. Qh5+ Kg8 19. Bxg6 fxg6 20. Qxg6+ Kh8 21. Qh6+ Kg8 22. g6 Rf7 23. gxf7+ Kxf7 24. Qh5+ Kg7 { Key: 24...Kg7? 24...Kg8 held (engine 0.03 against +4.7). } 25. f5 exf5 26. Bh6+ { Key: 25.f5 exf5 26.Bh6+: the last piece joins the attack. } 26... Kh7 27. Bg5+ Kg8 28. Qg6+ Kh8 1-0

