1. d4 Nf6 2. Nf3 d6 3. b3 g6 4. Bb2 Bg7 5. Nbd2 O-O 6. e4 Nc6 7. Bd3 Re8 8. d5 Nb8 9. O-O Nxe4 10. Bxg7 Nxd2 11. Bb2 Nxf1 12. Bxf1 { Key: 9...Nxe4 10.Bxg7 Nxd2 11.Bb2 Nxf1 12.Bxf1: White is the exchange down for Black's dark-squared bishop. The engine prefers 12.Qc1, heading for h6, to the recapture (+0.6 against -0.8). } 12... e5 13. dxe6 fxe6 14. Qd4 { Key: 14.Qd4? misses 14.Bc4, aiming at the open black king along the diagonal (engine +1.2 against -0.8). } 14... e5 15. Bc4+ Kg7 16. Qd2 Qf6 17. Re1 Nc6 18. Re4 Be6 19. Rf4 Qd8 20. Rh4 h5 21. Bc1 Qf6 22. Qh6+ Kg8 23. Ng5 { Key: 23.Ng5? 23.Bd3 kept the attack going (engine -0.8 against -2.0). } 23... Bxc4 24. Qh7+ Kf8 25. Ne4 Qf7 26. Qh6+ Qg7 27. bxc4 Qxh6 28. Bxh6+ Kf7 { Key: 27...Qxh6 28.Bxh6+: queens off. Burn is the exchange and a pawn up and defends the ending patiently. } 29. Rh3 Nd4 30. c3 Nf5 31. Bg5 Ke6 32. g4 hxg4 33. Rh7 Rac8 34. Bh6 d5 35. cxd5+ Kxd5 36. Nd2 Re6 37. Bg5 Ra6 38. h3 gxh3 39. Rxh3 Rxa2 40. Rd3+ Ke6 41. Ne4 b6 42. Bd8 Nd6 43. Ng5+ Kd7 44. Bf6 Rf8 45. Bxe5 Rfxf2 46. Nf3 Rfb2 47. Rd1 Rg2+ 48. Kh1 Rgf2 49. Nd4 Rad2 50. Ra1 a5 51. Bg3 Rg2 52. Bf4 Ra2 53. Rd1 Rgf2 54. Bg3 Rfd2 55. Re1 Nf5 56. Bf4 Nxd4 57. cxd4 Rxd4 58. Bg3 Rd3 59. Rf1 Rc2 60. Re1 a4 61. Rd1 { Key: 61.Rd1 Rxd1+ and mate follows (engine: mate in 2). } 61... Rxd1+ 0-1

